          <p>MEAICON's IoT and edge computing practice covers the full stack — from sensor selection and network design through edge processing, data ingestion, and integration with enterprise applications. We design sensor networks that capture the right data at the right frequency, edge computing infrastructure that processes data close to its source for low-latency decision-making, and data pipelines that reliably transport and transform IoT data.</p>
          <p>We address the unique challenges of IoT deployments at scale — device onboarding and authentication, firmware management, connectivity in remote locations, and the security considerations that come with thousands of connected endpoints. Whether you are monitoring industrial equipment, managing building systems, or deploying environmental sensors, we build the infrastructure to make your IoT investment deliver value.</p>
